%F A000682 a(n) = 2*A000560(n-1) for n >= 3.
%F A000682 For n >= 2, a(n) = 2^(n-2) + Sum_{x=3..n-2} (2^(n-x-2)*A301620(x)). - _Roger Ford_, Apr 23 2018
%F A000682 a(n) = 2^(n-2) + Sum_{j=4..n-1} (Sum_{k=3..floor((j+2)/2)} (A259689(j,k)*(k-2)*2^(n-1-j))). - _Roger Ford_, Dec 12 2018
%F A000682 a(n) = A000136(n)/n. - _Jean-François Alcover_, Sep 06 2019, from formula in A000136.
%F A000682 a(n) = (n-1)! - Sum_{k=3..n-1} (A223094(k) * (n-1)! / k!). - _Roger Ford_, Aug 23 2024
%F A000682 From _Hunter Hogan_, Oct 12 2026: (Start)
%F A000682 a(n) = A001010(2*n-2)/2 for n >= 3.
%F A000682 a(n) = (4*A001011(n) - A001010(n))/n for n >= 3.
%F A000682 a(n) = A223093(n-1) + A077014(n-1) for n >= 3.
%F A000682 a(n) = A223093(n-1) + (1 + (n mod 2))*A005316(n-1) for n >= 3.
%F A000682 a(n) = (A217310(n-1) + 2*A005316(n-1))/(2 - (n mod 2)) for n >= 3.
%F A000682 a(n) = (2 - (n mod 2))*A227167(n)/n for n >= 3.
%F A000682 a(n) = (A000136(n-1) + A077014(n-1) - A223095(n-1))/2 for n >= 3.
%F A000682 a(n) = (n-1)*a(n-1) - A223094(n-1) for n >= 3.
%F A000682 a(n) = 2*(a(n-1) + A259702(n)) = 2*a(n-1) + A301620(n-2) for n >= 4.
%F A000682 a(n) = a(n-1) + A333971(n+1)/4 for n >= 4.
%F A000682 a(n) = A334615(n) + 4*a(n-1) - 4*a(n-2) for n >= 4.
%F A000682 a(n) = A337581(n+2)/4 for n >= 3.
%F A000682 a(n) = A287548(n,n) = A331499(n,1) for n >= 1.
%F A000682 a(n) = Sum_{k=1..floor(n/2)} A400429(n,k) for n >= 2. (End)
%e A000682 a(4) = 4: the four solutions with three crossings are the two solutions shown in A086441(3) together with their reflections about a North-South axis.
